# Build-time-fetched vendor assets, not product code: the Whisper model
# snapshot and the ONNX WASM runtime, mirrored into public/ by
# `npm run fetch:model` (see scripts/fetch-model.mjs). Never committed —
# every deploy fetches or restores them from a warm disk instead.
public/models/
public/ort/

# Local-only working documents: planning notes, codebase maps, review write-ups
# and assistant/editor state. These describe the work, not the product, and some
# of it (the code review) catalogues weak points — it does not belong in the
# repo even while it is private.
.claude
.planning/
.gsd/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# Installed agent skills and their lockfile. Local tooling, not product code —
# each machine installs what it wants via `npx skills add`.
.agents/
skills-lock.json
